  "notes": [
   "GA4 bookings are the CREATE PATH only: eventName EXACT sevenrooms_booking_complete AND pagePath NOT PARTIAL_REGEXP modify|manage|prearrival. Boundary date 12 October 2026. Second HK week on this basis.",
   "Amendment share of gross: 0.4 per cent in W38 (gross 560 against create path 558) and 4.1 per cent in W37. The 2025 side is unchanged because no modify, manage or prearrival page paths exist in the 2025 data at any HK venue, so all three columns are on the same basis.",
   "VERIFIED against last week's published payload: create-path W31 to W37 reproduces last week's figures exactly for all nine venues; gross W37 reproduces last week's gross for all nine; YTD gross equals last week's published YTD plus this week's gross exactly for all nine (Aqua 7241+156=7397, Hutong 10390+149=10539, TCL 4353+58=4411, Cantina 2535+23=2558, DSL 5735+93=5828, Shiro PP 2967+41=3008, Shiro TK 2335+40=2375, Vesu 1487+51=1538, Canton 204+65=269).",
   "THE HEADLINE: the sevenrooms_booking_complete tag is STILL under-recording, eleven days after it broke on 15 to 16 October. Ratio of GA4 create-path bookings to SevenRooms website booking rows, 19-25 Oct: Dim Sum Library 0.74, Aqua HK 0.66, Shiro Tai Kwun 0.65, The Chinese Library 0.64, Vesu 0.59, Hutong HK 0.57, Shiro Pacific Place 0.55, Cantina 0.43, portfolio 0.62. The Canton Library reads 0.93 and is the only clean property. A healthy property reads 1.0 or better because GA4 is gross of cancellations and includes the bar.",
   "Cantina recovered from three days of zero events (16-18 Oct) to 2,1,2,4,4,3,7 on 19-25 Oct against SevenRooms website rows of 7,10,10,5,5,3,13. Its book_now_button_click event tripled, 64 in W37 to 173 in W38, alongside a new GA4 Paid Other channel (12 sessions to 246) and 265 sessions landing on /thedispensarybar. Those are observations; the source of that paid traffic is not identifiable from GA4 and is not in the Meta or Google campaign lists.",
   "averageSessionDuration is still inflated 3 to 6 times at every venue except The Canton Library. Aqua daily: 2694s on 19 Oct and 2830s on 20 Oct against a normal 190 to 220, easing to 226 to 713s by 24-25 Oct. Weekly: Aqua 1092s (746s prior), Hutong 748s, TCL 510s, Cantina 372s, DSL 838s, Shiro combined 898s, Vesu 1418s, Canton 107.9s (92.4s two weeks ago). Engagement and bounce for the week are not usable.",
   "bounce and engrate are RAW 0-1 FRACTIONS from the GA4 API. asd = averageSessionDuration in seconds. Current-week engagement metrics are provisional and this week they are also distorted by the tag break.",
   "weekly buckets built with GA4 isoYearIsoWeek (Mon-Sun); users pulled with isoYearIsoWeek as a dimension, never summed from daily. Prior-week site metrics re-pulled: Aqua W37 users 3360 identical to last week published, sessions settled 4546 to 4582 and then 4559 on the two-week pull.",
   "YTD is a single un-dimensioned eventCount call over 2026-02-01..2026-10-25 on the OLD GROSS basis, so the YTD line stays continuous with every published week.",
   "The Chinese Library (356942576) and Cantina (359148527) time out on 7-metric calls; pulled in a 4-metric and a 3-metric group.",
   "Shiro Pacific Place = combined Shiro minus Shiro Tai Kwun (users, sessions, pageviews and newUsers are residuals, not a direct pull). Tai Kwun users use pagePath PARTIAL_REGEXP central|taikwun; Tai Kwun bookings use eventName + pagePath PARTIAL_REGEXP shirotaikwun. Pacific Place engagement metrics are read directly with a NOT filter on that page path. The 2025 Tai Kwun filter returns no data, re-verified twice this week.",
   "Shiro split sums: create path Tai Kwun 40 + Pacific Place 41 = combined 81; the channel splits sum to 81 as well. YTD 2375 + 3008 = 5383 (direct combined pull).",
   "All landing pages aggregate each venue top-5 landing pages by path, so the list is indicative not exhaustive. (not set) and empty-string rows are excluded."
  ],
