 "tracking_break": {
  "finding": "GA4 sevenrooms_booking_complete is still under-recording across the HK estate 11 days after the 15-16 Oct break. It is no longer a total outage anywhere: Cantina went from three days of zero events to partial recording. It is a persistent partial loss of roughly a third to a half of events at every venue except The Canton Library.",
  "proof": "GA4 create-path bookings against SevenRooms website booking rows, 19-25 Oct, per venue: Aqua 154/233, Hutong 149/260, TCL 58/90, Cantina 23/53, DSL 93/125, Shiro PP 41/74, Shiro TK 40/62, Vesu 50/85, Canton 57/61. Portfolio 558/897. SevenRooms website rows rose 18.5 per cent week on week while GA4 fell 5.1 per cent.",
  "baseline": "Two reference points for a healthy ratio: The Canton Library at 0.93 this week, and Aqua HK's own 12-15 Oct window before the break at 1.05 (GA4 116 against SevenRooms 111).",
  "secondary": "averageSessionDuration still inflated 3-6x everywhere except Canton. Meta Schedule conversion still crushed: Aqua 10, Hutong 1, TCL 2, Cantina 2, DSL 2, Shiro 7, Vesu 2 against Canton 19.",
  "unaffected": "The Canton Library (property 548638742) remains clean on all three symptoms.",
  "changed_since_last_week": "Yes, materially. Last week this was reported as a break from 15-16 October with Cantina at zero. This week it is a continuing partial loss at eight of nine properties, nothing has been fixed, and the demand picture underneath it is strongly up rather than flat."
 },
